Yeah. No, you're right, though. I mean, like, so look at the end of the day, this is really like strategy slash simulation.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:36.600
Right. And that is a common video game genre.

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:39.080
Now. It's just weird to see it here on the NES.

00:01:39.320 --> 00:01:40.920
