00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:45.140
No, I wasn't.

00:01:45.280 --> 00:02:00.500
I think in our the last like retrospective episode, I was looking into some some games that were coming out over the year and I did see what looked like a pretty in-depth strategy game.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:02.640
