Now, I'm doing the ending.

01:00:54.940 --> 01:01:01.820
Now, the zapper game. But they're not supposed to know that it's the ending because now they're, like, they're probably closing us out right now.

01:01:01.980 --> 01:01:03.540
Oh, sorry for blowing you under.

01:01:03.540 --> 01:01:04.880
Right now. Yeah.

01:01:05.820 --> 01:01:07.940
So, it's fine. This is the end of the episode.

01:01:08.160 --> 01:01:09.400
Shooting Range next week.

01:01:09.400 --> 01:01:10.420
Really basic game.

01:01:10.500 --> 01:01:12.440
It sounds like it. But we're going to find out if it's any good.

